{"format":"vecta/0.1","id":"pythagoras","title":"Pythagoras' theorem","subject":"Maths","level":"Ages 13-15","language":"en","voice":"placeholder","duration":42.55,"board":{"aspect":"16:9"},"audio":[{"src":"voice.opus","type":"audio/ogg; codecs=opus"},{"src":"voice.m4a","type":"audio/mp4"}],"captions":[{"t":0.0,"text":"This is Pythagoras' theorem. It works for right angled triangles."},{"t":5.41,"text":"Here is a right angled triangle. The small square marks the right angle."},{"t":10.99,"text":"The two shorter sides are three and four."},{"t":14.51,"text":"The longest side is opposite the right angle. It is called the hypotenuse. We call it c."},{"t":21.28,"text":"The theorem says. A squared, plus b squared, equals c squared."},{"t":27.29,"text":"So three squared, plus four squared, equals c squared."},{"t":32.35,"text":"Nine plus sixteen is twenty five."},{"t":35.66,"text":"c squared is twenty five, so c is the square root of twenty five. That is five."}],"elements":[{"t":0.2,"type":"text","value":"Pythagoras' theorem","x":50,"y":11,"size":7,"weight":700},{"t":5.81,"type":"line","x1":12,"y1":82,"x2":39,"y2":82,"dur":0.7},{"t":6.51,"type":"line","x1":12,"y1":82,"x2":12,"y2":46,"dur":0.7},{"t":7.21,"type":"line","x1":12,"y1":46,"x2":39,"y2":82,"dur":0.8},{"t":8.81,"type":"line","x1":12,"y1":77.5,"x2":14.53,"y2":77.5,"color":"accent","dur":0.2},{"t":9.01,"type":"line","x1":14.53,"y1":77.5,"x2":14.53,"y2":82,"color":"accent","dur":0.2},{"t":11.89,"type":"text","value":"3","x":8.5,"y":64,"size":5.5},{"t":12.79,"type":"text","value":"4","x":25.5,"y":90,"size":5.5},{"t":14.91,"type":"line","x1":12,"y1":46,"x2":39,"y2":82,"color":"accent","dur":0.8},{"t":19.11,"type":"text","value":"c","x":28.5,"y":59,"size":6,"color":"accent","italic":true},{"t":22.08,"type":"math","value":"a^2 + b^2 = c^2","x":70,"y":28,"size":7},{"t":27.69,"type":"math","value":"3^2 + 4^2 = c^2","x":70,"y":44,"size":6},{"t":32.65,"type":"math","value":"9 + 16 = 25","x":70,"y":59,"size":6},{"t":36.86,"type":"math","value":"c = \\sqrt{25} = 5","x":70,"y":77,"size":7,"color":"accent","box":true}]}